        "TileImage": "$($repository ab22f88d-f567-43a2-b20f-0ecc17257ffe).Image",
        "Description": "Greetings, 47. Your destination is the Palais De Walewska in Paris, France. Your targets are Helmut Kruger, star fashion model working for Sanguine, and Olivier Lauzier, chef and registered serial poisoner.\r\rThe two men are part of a secret plot to eliminate several important guests at the palace by putting lethal poison in their food - Lauzier makes the deadly meals, and Kruger diverts attention away from the kitchen.\r\rWe must eliminate them before they can cause any harm. Good luck, 47.",
